Create variable
    Result → Int32
    Num → Int32
    UserInput → String

Add Try Catch activity.
Inside Try

→ Add Input Dialog activity.
    Dialog title → "Enter Number"
    Input label → "Enter number"
    Input type → Text Box
    Value entered → UserInput

→ Add Assign activity.
    To variable → Num
    Set value → Convert.ToInt32(UserInput)

→ Add Assign activity.
    To variable → Result
    Set value → 500 / Num

→ Add Message Box.
    Text → "Result = " + Result.ToString

Catch Format Exception

→ Add Message Box.
    Text → "Invalid input. Please enter number only"

Catch Divide By Zero Exception

→ Add Message Box.
    Text → Exception.Message

Finally

→ Add Message Box.
    Text → "Process Completed"
